  "statement_html": "\t  <style>\t .enonce{margin-bottom:0}\t .qcm_prompt2{margin-top:.5em}\t img{vertical-align:middle;}\t .q_num, .panel .wims_title{\t font-size:120%;font-family:Impact, Charcoal, sans-serif;\t color:#777;\t }\t .feedback{border:1px dashed grey;padding:.5em;margin-top:.5em;}\t .reponse {\t   margin: 0 1em;\t   padding: .5em;\t   border-radius:5px;\t   color:#555;font-size:90%;\t }\t .panel{\t    padding:.5em 1em .5em 1em;\t    margin:.5em 0;\t    border:1px solid #d8d8d8;\t    border-radius:5px;\t }\t .panel.callout{\t    border-color:#c5e5f3;\t    border-width:2px;\t    background-color: #F2F9FC;\t }\t .callout .q_num, .callout .wims_title{color:black;}\t\t .panel .wims_title, .panel .wimscenter{margin-top:-1.2em;}\t ol li{margin-bottom: .5em;list-style:upper-alpha;}\t input[type='checkbox'] { font-size:120%; }\t .strike{text-decoration:line-through;}\t .oef_indpartial{color:navy;}\t </style>\t  <div class=\"instruction\">Lors d'un contrôle de qualité, on note \\(X\\) la variable aléatoire discrète dénombrant le nombre de pièces défectueuses observées.\t\\(X\\) prend donc des valeurs entières.\t<br>Pour chaque question, indiquer <u>toutes les bonnes réponses</u>.</div>\t\t   \t                   <div class=\"panel callout\">         \t        <div class=\"enonce\">\t       <span class=\"q_num\">1. </span>                <span class=\"question\">La probabilité que dans cet échantillon il y ait moins de \\(2\\) pièces défectueuses est:</span>\t     </div>\t    \t    \t            <div class=\"question\">\t        <ol>\t            <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"1\" /> \\(P{\\left(X < 2 \\right)}\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"2\" /> \\(P(X\\geq 2)\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"3\" /> \\(P(X\\leq 3)\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"4\" /> \\(P(X\\leq 2)\\)</label></li>          </ol>\t      </div>\t              </div>    \t                   <div class=\"panel callout\">         \t        <div class=\"enonce\">\t       <span class=\"q_num\">2. </span>                <span class=\"question\">La probabilité que dans cet échantillon il y ait entre \\(2\\) et \\(9\\) pièces défectueuses (\\(2\\) et \\(9\\) incluses) est :</span>\t     </div>\t    \t    \t            <div class=\"question\">\t        <ol>\t            <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply2\" value=\"1\" /> \\(P(3\\leq X\\leq8)\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply2\" value=\"2\" /> \\(P(2\\leq X\\leq9)\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply2\" value=\"3\" /> \\(P{\\left(3 < X \\wedge X < 8 \\right)}\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply2\" value=\"4\" /> \\(P(X\\leq9)-P(X\\leq 2)\\)</label></li>          </ol>\t      </div>\t              </div>    \t                   <div class=\"panel callout\">         \t        <div class=\"enonce\">\t       <span class=\"q_num\">3. </span>                <span class=\"question\">La probabilité que dans cet échantillon il y ait plus de \\(2\\) pièces défectueuses est :</span>\t     </div>\t    \t    \t            <div class=\"question\">\t        <ol>\t            <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"1\" /> \\(P(X\\geq3)\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"2\" /> \\(P(X\\leq 2)\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"3\" /> \\(1-P(X\\leq 1)\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"4\" /> \\(P{\\left(X > 2 \\right)}\\)</label></li>          </ol>\t      </div>\t              </div>    \t                   <div class=\"panel callout\">         \t        <div class=\"enonce\">\t       <span class=\"q_num\">4. </span>                <span class=\"question\">La probabilité que dans cet échantillon il y ait au plus \\(2\\) pièces défectueuses est :</span>\t     </div>\t    \t    \t            <div class=\"question\">\t        <ol>\t            <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply4\" value=\"1\" /> \\(P(X\\leq 1)\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply4\" value=\"2\" /> \\(P{\\left(X < 2 \\right)}\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply4\" value=\"3\" /> \\(P(X\\leq 2)\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply4\" value=\"4\" /> \\(P{\\left(X > 2 \\right)}\\)</label></li>          </ol>\t      </div>\t              </div>     ",
